...]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;这篇文章&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/theres-a-new-way-to-meet-cute-guys-but-does-it-actually-work/"&gt;有一种结识可爱男人的新方法，但它真的有效吗？&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 14:56:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/theres-a-new-way-to-meet-cute-guys-but-does-it-actually-work/</guid></item><item><title>治疗师表示，与新朋友睡觉前要问的 4 个问题</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/4-questions-to-ask-before-sleeping-with-someone-new-according-to-therapists/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在和新朋友睡觉之前进行“交谈”并不是最性感的，这可能就是为什么很多人会跳过它并希望得到最好的结果。性爱发生了，问题稍后才出现。有时要晚很多。一项新的研究发现，对情感亲密的期望对性欲的影响比对[…]的期望更大。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/4-questions-to-ask-before-sleeping-with-someone-new-according-to-therapists/"&gt;根据治疗师的说法，与新人睡觉前要问的 4 个问题&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 14:46:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/4-questions-to-ask-before-sleeping-with-someone-new-according-to-therapists/</guid></item><item><title>万智牌详细介绍即将举行的现实断裂竞技场活动</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/magic-the-gathering-details-upcoming-reality-fracture-arena-events/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;万智牌玩家可以在万智牌竞技场上查看即将举行的现实断裂活动的所有日期和详细信息。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/magic-the-gathering-details-upcoming-reality-fracture-arena-events/"&gt;万智牌详细信息即将到来的现实断裂竞技场活动&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 14:40:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/magic-the-gathering-details-upcoming-reality-fracture-arena-events/</guid></item><item><title>为什么你继续和你应该离开的人睡觉（以及如何停止）</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/why-you-keep-sleeping-with-someone-you-know-you-should-leave/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;